Sound diagnostics, for machines that stay silent:
 - startup lists PCI audio devices (vendor:device, class; flags a non-HDA
   class such as an Intel audio DSP), how many codecs AudioDxe bound,
   every output port, and the path finally chosen
 - the chosen path is shown in the HUD message line when the first level
   starts, so it can be read without catching the startup text
 - -sndout N picks another output port (e.g. the front headphone jack)
 - -sndinfo pauses after the audio setup text until a key is pressed

diff --git a/uefidoom/d_main.c b/uefidoom/d_main.c
